{"2026.6.4:P01-Q15":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>亚硝酰氟与有机键数计量</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.6.4 · 终极押题猜想专题练习 · 押题猜想04 阿伏加德罗常数的值计算  第1题 · P01-Q15</div><h1>亚硝酰氟与有机键数计量</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：认识化学科学/物质的量/阿伏加德罗常数</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：综合计算转移电子、σ键和可逆反应中的微粒数。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化还原反应的应用/氧化还原反应有关计算</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/原子结构 化学键/化学键/共价键</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学平衡/化学平衡状态</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/盐类的水解/盐类水解原理</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>1．设<img src=\"chem-asset:91c211ca8f41e9cb4172f1c93a736b066558c9b25dca614a4ea4af4a803ef6b3:0;\" style=\"width:21.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">为阿伏加德罗常数的值。下列叙述错误的是</p><p>A．0.5 mol NO和足量<img src=\"chem-asset:40c75e0ea0ad94b352db1d44ccf3704a6114f3aa8a99034bc1ad272fe1bc950b:1;\" style=\"width:15.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">反应生成0.5 mol NOF时转移电子数为<img src=\"chem-asset:76317e652dbdce8fcb64bc5fbfb1de8d9c1db3f718b99e1c8b22387fd1dbe34b:2;\" style=\"width:38.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>B．1 mol有机物<img src=\"chem-asset:05700b248d48fa0a860efb0f054433af440e900d8020cfc8211eae24f6333d6f:3;\" style=\"width:75.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">含有<img src=\"chem-asset:841de1b1e92d11262ed73ec2d21d7bed47474a965b1a610595f3b5c90d81fa30:4;\" style=\"width:14.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">键<img src=\"chem-asset:b0bae629e2fc2cc68e247e1a16fff7115dffe3e60ea286fb40c81805f9db5c3d:5;\" style=\"width:34.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>C．<img src=\"chem-asset:adc19fcb8813c5508180bf197c09ede2dfd7b93f01bb09e7b0c713fc1bbce9fa:6;\" style=\"width:51.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶于足量水，所得溶液中<img src=\"chem-asset:27237f16c99f1615259d8088cab53d2afaac9a9bf56da6420c05cb598717ec4c:7;\" style=\"width:37.47px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:8cc2a11bebba83fe8d6499c831900e9142ca6d43fd7ccc63f450c2187cfd594f:8;\" style=\"width:22.27px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:76e38d9f54c1e5c0098b8bdb36a37ebcca9b60cf0b0a882a3bf999252bed0a04:9;\" style=\"width:32.80px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">粒子数之和为<img src=\"chem-asset:7feea3edf296d475db3612a3897b01cba8f983942c1bfa36b7c95c01ec66f037:10;\" style=\"width:29.27px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>D．常温常压下，33.6 L NO所含有的分子数小于<img src=\"chem-asset:0bfda7454463eeb9970c9390ae248d50fcb016bc40c664c9056d70c450b33eff:11;\" style=\"width:37.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】C</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【详解】A．反应为 <img src=\"chem-asset:36b745ca8c93be8f8450c5ac0e6e10c9c67e11a8fc89c2bbe6685e934e0479a4:12;\" style=\"width:107.93px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:f2014ffd40a4e4cf01cbd4642d3c3cd8e30d436bdfcc96a4ffbabca88164b946:13;\" style=\"width:24.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"> 中<img src=\"chem-asset:597f7d33fe0659d0bd264458cf1bbb69f8cbc1d62adb913830d3177c0c753109:14;\" style=\"width:15.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">为<img src=\"chem-asset:47bbc35b6aff68ffd3cfc3ea12174b25554952df7120de84a7de61b3659679d0:15;\" style=\"width:18.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">价，<img src=\"chem-asset:9eedf0b5899ed61787e74f618966fd9333bcb9bb09fbf7e48e4f114fcdeae158:16;\" style=\"width:35.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">中<img src=\"chem-asset:597f7d33fe0659d0bd264458cf1bbb69f8cbc1d62adb913830d3177c0c753109:14;\" style=\"width:15.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">为<img src=\"chem-asset:0e4147a987a077ca5132736e7177c330842798d9de0797f5797962213ba722f8:17;\" style=\"width:18.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">价，<img src=\"chem-asset:49a663aa6717409a7f413523ce287441464499ebcaa6a6fc621c23d08c4dcef4:18;\" style=\"width:50.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">反应转移<img src=\"chem-asset:ebe6b51dd65c076df8a5dc9f94c6de2ab3f4404fa71b5f3c1a8a9368e0f01ed0:19;\" style=\"width:30.47px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">电子，因此<img src=\"chem-asset:290c8491b4bad9a8fcf36d6306f69830f519da9a7ffc0c9d99349f39850907bd:20;\" style=\"width:63.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">生成<img src=\"chem-asset:864d43cb84166ba410d4d61cfc24570a703aee44c1b20fd585fa1020489bdc45:21;\" style=\"width:72.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">时转移电子数为<img src=\"chem-asset:76317e652dbdce8fcb64bc5fbfb1de8d9c1db3f718b99e1c8b22387fd1dbe34b:22;\" style=\"width:38.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，A正确；</p><p>B．该有机物单键均为<img src=\"chem-asset:841de1b1e92d11262ed73ec2d21d7bed47474a965b1a610595f3b5c90d81fa30:23;\" style=\"width:14.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">键，双键含1个<img src=\"chem-asset:841de1b1e92d11262ed73ec2d21d7bed47474a965b1a610595f3b5c90d81fa30:23;\" style=\"width:14.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">键、1个<img src=\"chem-asset:779c1fd14f41e5170920189ce33a2e6ed842ccb05305f92f40e16ee07ee6c89b:24;\" style=\"width:12.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">键：总共有4个碳碳<img src=\"chem-asset:841de1b1e92d11262ed73ec2d21d7bed47474a965b1a610595f3b5c90d81fa30:23;\" style=\"width:14.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">键和8个碳氢<img src=\"chem-asset:841de1b1e92d11262ed73ec2d21d7bed47474a965b1a610595f3b5c90d81fa30:23;\" style=\"width:14.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">键，共12个<img src=\"chem-asset:841de1b1e92d11262ed73ec2d21d7bed47474a965b1a610595f3b5c90d81fa30:23;\" style=\"width:14.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">键，因此<img src=\"chem-asset:ebe6b51dd65c076df8a5dc9f94c6de2ab3f4404fa71b5f3c1a8a9368e0f01ed0:19;\" style=\"width:30.47px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">该有机物含<img src=\"chem-asset:841de1b1e92d11262ed73ec2d21d7bed47474a965b1a610595f3b5c90d81fa30:23;\" style=\"width:14.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">键<img src=\"chem-asset:b0bae629e2fc2cc68e247e1a16fff7115dffe3e60ea286fb40c81805f9db5c3d:25;\" style=\"width:34.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，B正确；</p><p>C．<img src=\"chem-asset:bad56b2a5d7611dd642b906e401cb727461e7f1e64a9d707bb2e5448bb98c2fd:26;\" style=\"width:21.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶于水的反应为可逆反应，溶液中存在未反应的<img src=\"chem-asset:bad56b2a5d7611dd642b906e401cb727461e7f1e64a9d707bb2e5448bb98c2fd:26;\" style=\"width:21.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">分子，根据物料守恒：<img src=\"chem-asset:a2c931399605ab45e2d98338f4fc167e152cab21bc5844dacf0eba9bf7317408:27;\" style=\"width:274.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，因此<img src=\"chem-asset:5ee68fe29a44ea6443c4c44cb243bee4a72747a9bb3a146c274a8635f99d4997:28;\" style=\"width:38.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:f6de737bbe5c7ddf40e96a7cdadc2f224090b7aff0536ddf21951e9051a28989:29;\" style=\"width:23.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:bbe5bb5e934db197a91f84a34cc4dc276eb77dd21b708ec5fdc2f8abce92857d:30;\" style=\"width:32.80px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的粒子数之和小于<img src=\"chem-asset:7feea3edf296d475db3612a3897b01cba8f983942c1bfa36b7c95c01ec66f037:31;\" style=\"width:29.27px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，C错误；</p><p>D．标准状况下<img src=\"chem-asset:ab704a97a8f937ab93797e1c970d996a4c4c4adb6e4c5c64a7de5b65a635580f:32;\" style=\"width:57.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">物质的量为<img src=\"chem-asset:762db2a3ccada2621288ff5052e0408bdad1050e208eefe56dc431937ab5a1fb:33;\" style=\"width:42.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，常温常压温度更高，气体摩尔体积大于22.4L/mol，33.6LNO气体物质的量小于1.5mol，因此所含分子数小于<img src=\"chem-asset:0bfda7454463eeb9970c9390ae248d50fcb016bc40c664c9056d70c450b33eff:34;\" style=\"width:37.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，D正确；</p><p>故选C。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.6.4\\化学终极押题猜想（湖南专用）2026年高考化学终极冲刺讲练测\\化学终极押题猜想（湖南专用）2026年高考化学终极冲刺讲练测\\化学终极押题猜想（湖南专用）（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.6.4/%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E7%BB%88%E6%9E%81%E6%8A%BC%E9%A2%98%E7%8C%9C%E6%83%B3%EF%BC%88%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E4%B8%93%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%892026%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E7%BB%88%E6%9E%81%E5%86%B2%E5%88%BA%E8%AE%B2%E7%BB%83%E6%B5%8B/%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E7%BB%88%E6%9E%81%E6%8A%BC%E9%A2%98%E7%8C%9C%E6%83%B3%EF%BC%88%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E4%B8%93%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%892026%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E7%BB%88%E6%9E%81%E5%86%B2%E5%88%BA%E8%AE%B2%E7%BB%83%E6%B5%8B/%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E7%BB%88%E6%9E%81%E6%8A%BC%E9%A2%98%E7%8C%9C%E6%83%B3%EF%BC%88%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E4%B8%93%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["05700b248d48fa0a860efb0f054433af440e900d8020cfc8211eae24f6333d6f","0bfda7454463eeb9970c9390ae248d50fcb016bc40c664c9056d70c450b33eff","0e4147a987a077ca5132736e7177c330842798d9de0797f5797962213ba722f8","27237f16c99f1615259d8088cab53d2afaac9a9bf56da6420c05cb598717ec4c","290c8491b4bad9a8fcf36d6306f69830f519da9a7ffc0c9d99349f39850907bd","36b745ca8c93be8f8450c5ac0e6e10c9c67e11a8fc89c2bbe6685e934e0479a4","40c75e0ea0ad94b352db1d44ccf3704a6114f3aa8a99034bc1ad272fe1bc950b","47bbc35b6aff68ffd3cfc3ea12174b25554952df7120de84a7de61b3659679d0","49a663aa6717409a7f413523ce287441464499ebcaa6a6fc621c23d08c4dcef4","597f7d33fe0659d0bd264458cf1bbb69f8cbc1d62adb913830d3177c0c753109","5ee68fe29a44ea6443c4c44cb243bee4a72747a9bb3a146c274a8635f99d4997","762db2a3ccada2621288ff5052e0408bdad1050e208eefe56dc431937ab5a1fb","76317e652dbdce8fcb64bc5fbfb1de8d9c1db3f718b99e1c8b22387fd1dbe34b","76e38d9f54c1e5c0098b8bdb36a37ebcca9b60cf0b0a882a3bf999252bed0a04","779c1fd14f41e5170920189ce33a2e6ed842ccb05305f92f40e16ee07ee6c89b","7feea3edf296d475db3612a3897b01cba8f983942c1bfa36b7c95c01ec66f037","841de1b1e92d11262ed73ec2d21d7bed47474a965b1a610595f3b5c90d81fa30","864d43cb84166ba410d4d61cfc24570a703aee44c1b20fd585fa1020489bdc45","8cc2a11bebba83fe8d6499c831900e9142ca6d43fd7ccc63f450c2187cfd594f","91c211ca8f41e9cb4172f1c93a736b066558c9b25dca614a4ea4af4a803ef6b3","9eedf0b5899ed61787e74f618966fd9333bcb9bb09fbf7e48e4f114fcdeae158","a2c931399605ab45e2d98338f4fc167e152cab21bc5844dacf0eba9bf7317408","ab704a97a8f937ab93797e1c970d996a4c4c4adb6e4c5c64a7de5b65a635580f","adc19fcb8813c5508180bf197c09ede2dfd7b93f01bb09e7b0c713fc1bbce9fa","b0bae629e2fc2cc68e247e1a16fff7115dffe3e60ea286fb40c81805f9db5c3d","bad56b2a5d7611dd642b906e401cb727461e7f1e64a9d707bb2e5448bb98c2fd","bbe5bb5e934db197a91f84a34cc4dc276eb77dd21b708ec5fdc2f8abce92857d","ebe6b51dd65c076df8a5dc9f94c6de2ab3f4404fa71b5f3c1a8a9368e0f01ed0","f2014ffd40a4e4cf01cbd4642d3c3cd8e30d436bdfcc96a4ffbabca88164b946","f6de737bbe5c7ddf40e96a7cdadc2f224090b7aff0536ddf21951e9051a28989"],"sourceSha256":"9e2f9f6a8be7f076aa204bf5ed3a2e3759ab386b094a96cee2b899214b57006b"}}